@startuml

title Publishing a derived market object: compute, raise, decide, apply

actor "Trader\n(maker)" as maker
participant "Market data" as md
participant "Inbox" as inbox
actor "Decider\n(checker)" as checker
participant "Readers" as readers

== Compute ==
maker -> md : compute(subject, as-of)
md -> md : solve, check, store the candidate\nwith its lineage, as a version
md --> maker : candidate version and its checks

== Raise ==
maker -> md : raise publish(subject, as-of, reason)
md -> md : the subject is the session party's;\nno open request for it;\nnot older than the live set
md -> inbox : read the approvals mode and the kind\n(outside the raise transaction)
inbox --> md : the rule that applies, if any
group one transaction
  md -> inbox : write the request
  md -> md : write the subject:\nsubject, as-of, candidate version
end
alt a stated rule closes it
  inbox --> md : approved, decided by the system
  md -> md : apply at once (below)
else a person decides
  inbox --> md : waiting
  md --> maker : raised; waits on the decision
  inbox -> checker : a request waits
  checker -> inbox : approve (not the maker)
  inbox -> maker : the request is approved
  maker -> md : apply(request)
end

== Apply ==
md -> md : the request is of the kind, approved,\nnot applied; the subject matches;\nthe candidate is the version approved
group one transaction
  md -> md : publish the set; stamp publisher and instant
  md -> md : supersede every live set of the series
  md -> md : write the notice
end
md -> readers : the set of the series changed
md --> maker : published

@enduml
